WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Akuma blocks Ryu’s Drive Reversal at close range.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.600
Crouching medium punch punishes the blocked reversal.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.300
Standing heavy punch continues the punish.

4
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.400
Light Tatsu lifts Ryu beside the corner.

5
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.150
Heavy Tatsu juggles Ryu after light Tatsu.

6
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:05.650
Ryu recovers in the corner after the punish.
